@host = <API_BASE_URL>
@userId = <ACTIVE_USER_ID>
@ticketId = <TICKET_ID>

### Replace placeholders before sending requests.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "<USER_NAME>",
  "password": "<PASSWORD>"
}

### Main board excludes Rejected.
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/board
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Create a ticket. Reporter identity comes from the authenticated header.
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "ATM unavailable",
  "description": "The terminal screen is unresponsive."
}

### Ticket details include assignments and chronological history.
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Active eligible assignees. Operator or Supervisor required.
GET {{host}}/api/users
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
